{"item":{"key":"moment:2399094","id":"2399094","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"416752","name":"tsukasalol","avatar":"70748992f13c5fd3dcac10d9"},"time":1652630400000,"text":"A就是现在互联网上氛围最好的地方之一了，这里的肥肥个个说话都好听，又很爱惜平台，反而别的地方的戾气都挺严重的，抛开那些浮躁的东西其实真不一定能得到什么，只能说离开了这里也是一种损失吧。[emot=acfun,2421/]","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":507,"likeCount":694,"bananaCount":590,"shareCount":9},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/2399094","timePrecision":"day","commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":487,"archivedRoots":238,"threads":{"640374887":{"pages":["comments/2399094/threads/640374887/1.json"],"savedReplies":7,"reportedReplies":7,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"640374887","root":"640374887","user":{"id":"566672","name":"麟芯","avatar":"5542be16ef034fddf2b361a7"},"text":"文章区表示我被踢出a站了[emot=acfun,1657/]","time":1652692740397,"floor":234,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":7,"hot":false}},"640365274":{"pages":["comments/2399094/threads/640365274/1.json"],"savedReplies":3,"reportedReplies":3,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"640365274","root":"640365274","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]A站的氛围好，人情味浓，不是因为它是A站，而是因为它有ACer。\n网站的价值，一直在于用户。十多年来一直珍惜、用心守护这里的人，才让A站成为了A站。这是猴子、up主、普通用户共同努力和坚持传承A站精神的结果。\n我觉得核心的一点是大家都有一个共同的认知：首先你是一个ACer，然后你才是猴子、up主或普通用户。先谈整体和共同诉求，需有相互尊重理解的同理心，然后才有具体个人利益和立场。这个共识才让A站走到今天仍初心不改。[emot=acfun,1689/][/color]","time":1652690328404,"floor":229,"likes":44,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":3,"hot":false}},"640158148":{"pages":["comments/2399094/threads/640158148/1.json","comments/2399094/threads/640158148/2.json"],"savedReplies":24,"reportedReplies":26,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"640158148","root":"640158148","user":{"id":"61876820","name":"北辰不远QvQ","avatar":"cf55b485765775d7ac38ba54"},"text":"我是跟着你的直播间来A站的，感觉这里确实氛围还不错